Package: kmaudit
Type: Package
Title: Diagnostics for Kaplan-Meier Overestimation Under Competing Risks
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-11-09
Authors@R: person("Ferran", "Espuny-Pujol", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "f.espuny-pujol@reading.ac.uk")
Description: Provides a lightweight diagnostic layer for 
    measuring and interpreting KM overestimation and 
    assessing competing risks relevance in routine analyses. 
    Implements the Total Overestimation Diagnostic (TOD), 
    Order Index (OI), associated confidence intervals,
    and graphical audit methods.
